{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017LH1NPYN3P9nMoPqmnWCmQ","type":"tool_result","content":"# Total Farmers Markets\n\nTo find the total number of farmers markets across all states, I summed the \"farmers_markets\" column from the dataset.\n\nThe total is **8,589 farmers markets** across all states and territories included in this dataset.\n\nThis figure represents the combined count of farmers markets from California (647, the highest) through Virgin Islands (0, the lowest), encompassing all 50 states plus Washington D.C., Puerto Rico, and the Virgin Islands."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cd519ce2-2063-4ed4-b423-c6c56f2dd801","uuid":"d4605e10-8a57-4457-bdfd-016c892abcfd","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:47:04.961Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Total Farmers Markets\n\nTo find the total number of farmers markets across all states, I summed the \"farmers_markets\" column from the dataset.\n\nThe total is **8,589 farmers markets** across all states and territories included in this dataset.\n\nThis figure represents the combined count of farmers markets from California (647, the highest) through Virgin Islands (0, the lowest), encompassing all 50 states plus Washington D.C., Puerto Rico, and the Virgin Islands.","durationMs":1767,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
